  See Also:
    - :func:`jax.numpy.flip`: reverse the order along the given axis
    - :func:`jax.numpy.flipud`: reverse the order along axis 0

  Examples:
    >>> x = jnp.array([[1, 2],
    ...                [3, 4]])
    >>> jnp.fliplr(x)
    Array([[2, 1],
